      "value": "<p>A shell and bone bank two hundred metres across and up to three metres high, ringing a camp platform on the upper flat, built up over a great many returns to the same spot. The camp inside it is in use at every low water. The bank is still growing, at a rate the survey has measured twice and would rather not extrapolate from.</p>",
